<title>USA: INSIGHT - Soaring dollar/mark sets sights higher.</title>
<headline>INSIGHT - Soaring dollar/mark sets sights higher.</headline>
<text>
<p>DLR* *S/TERM RANGE  *SUPPORT *RESTNCE *RSI-14 *MA-8   *MA-13</p>
<p>DEM* *1.7825/1.8350 *1.8040  *1.8240  *79 pct *1.7947 *1.7798</p>
<p>YEN* *115.25/116.50 *115.40  *116.20  *54 pct *115.25 *114.46</p>
<p>-----------VIEWS FROM THE MARKET-------- July 22 ------------</p>
<p>*Dlr/mark six-year high 1.8430 targeted. Break from six-day range between 1.7840 to 1.8040 brings objective of 1.8240.</p>
<p>*Failure to hit that near-term may mean excessive dollar longs.</p>
<p>*Upward dollar/mark momentum pivots on holding low of 1.7955. *Dlr/yen pressured but still constructive above 115.25, which represents average of four hourly lows last week. Key support seen at last week's triangle breakout near 114.80.</p>
</text>
